	(text "Block diagram. Rails are global power symbols inside the sheets:\nVBUS (USB 5 V), VBAT (protected cell), VBAT_SW (after the on/off switch),\n+3V3 (ESP32-A1S), +3V3_USB (CH340C only), GND.\nSMD passives and LEDs 0805 wherever possible."
